    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nRetail Unit & One-Bedroom Apartment\n\nAn exceptional opportunity to acquire a mixed-use property in the heart of Kenmare town, comprising a ground-floor retail unit together with a one-bedroom apartment over.\n\nThe property was comprehensively renovated in 2009 and extends to approximately 74.4 sq. m. (800 sq. ft.) in total. \n\nThe apartment benefits from two balconies, including a second-floor balcony, together with a generous rooftop terrace offering excellent sunshine and attractive views across the mountains and Kenmare town.\n\nGround-Floor Retail Unit 26.3 sq. m. / 284 sq. ft.\n\nSituated on Henry Street, this well-presented retail unit enjoys a prominent town-centre position with excellent pedestrian footfall and strong visibility.\n\nThe property benefits from a large display window fronting onto Henry Street, providing an attractive shopfront and excellent exposure. Internally, the unit is bright and welcoming, featuring neutral décor and tiled flooring throughout.\n\nThe unit is ideally positioned close to a range of established local and national businesses, including AIB Bank, Maison Gourmet, Fat Face and Kenmare Ice Cream Shop.\n\n\nOne-Bedroom Apartment 48 sq. m./517 sq. ft.\n\nAccessed above the retail premises, the apartment provides well-appointed and contemporary accommodation arranged over two floors.\n\nThe first floor comprises a bright and spacious open-plan living area incorporating: fully fitted kitchen, integrated top range appliances, dining area, living room with modern oak side board , under stairs storage cupboard, Large flatscreen Sony OLED TV and large window overlooking Henry Street.\n\nThe second floor provides a generous double bedroom with built-in wardrobe and chest of drawers, together with a modern shower room.\n\nThe apartment is sold fully furnished.\n\nA particularly attractive feature of the apartment is the outdoor spaces with a balcony and a generous rooftop terrace. \n\nServices \nElectricity, electric storage heaters, mains water, mains sewerage, plinth heater (under sink), outdoorelectrical sockets and power points. fiber broadbandavailable. \n\nViewing by appointment only.\n\n**Interested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie**"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nNote 1 - \nRoom measurements are as per the floor plan and are for guidance purposes only.\n\nNote 2 - \nMap and photographs indicating boundaries are for illustration purposes only.\n\nCommercial Unit - \n\n\nGround Floor - \nRetail shop 284 sq. ft.A well-presented retail unit in a prime location in the heart of Kenmare town, with excellent visibility onto Henry Street.The premises is bright and welcoming, with a large display window overlooking Henry Street, neutral décor and a tiled floor. At the rear of the shop, a glass roof provides natural daylight.The unit also benefits from: good storage with WC, underfloor heating, Dimplex curtain heater over the entrance door, fire alarm, and security alarm. Ample high/low power electrical sockets throughout.\n\nApartment - \n\n\nFirst Floor - \nModern one-bedroom apartment situated on the first floor in the heart of Kenmare town.\n\nKitchen/Dining Room/ Living Room - \nThe apartment features a bright and spacious open-plan living area, incorporating a fully fitted kitchen with top range built-in appliances, a plinth heater(electric) under the sink, a dining area with a table for two, and a living room.The living room benefits from a large window overlooking Henry Street, providing excellent natural light. An under stairs storage cupboard. This area has attractive wooden flooring.\n\nSecond Floor - \nA wooden staircase leads to the second floor and large landing area suitable for seating/office workspace.\n\nDouble Bedroom - \nDouble bedroom with built-in wardrobes, wooden flooring and Velux skylight windows fitted with remote controlled blinds, which provide an abundance of natural daylight.\n\nShower Room - \nGood size bathroom with W.C., W.H.B., large top range Mira power shower, heated towel rail and Dimplex heater. The floor is tiled. Window looking out to balcony.\n\nBalcony - \nSecond-floor balcony with double doors opening onto the balcony, overlooking the rear of the property. Private not overlooked. New composite floor. Outside lighting.\n\nThird Floor - \n\n\nRoof Terrace - \nRoof Terrace 3.80m x 3.70m. A wonderful private outdoor space enjoying plenty of sunshine and offering views across to the mountains and over Kenmare town. Outside lighting. Outdoor electrical sockets/power points.\n\n"
      },
      {
