        "Content": "<ul><li>Special Features & Services</li><li>Prime town centre location</li><li>Mixed-use retail and residential investment</li><li>Retail accommodation of approximately 26.3 sq. m.</li><li>One-bedroom apartment of approximately 48 sq. m.</li><li>Comprehensively renovated in 2009</li><li>Two balconies - rooftop terrace</li><li>Strong pedestrian footfall</li><li>Fully furnished.</li><li></li><li>Services: Electricity, electric storage heaters, mains water, </li><li>mains sewerage, plinth heater (under sink), outdoor</li><li>electrical sockets and power points. fiber broadband</li><li>available. </li><li></li><li>Retail unit: underfloor heating, a Dimplex entrance</li><li>curtain heater, fire alarm and security alarm system.</li><li>Apartment: electric storage heaters.</li><li></li><li>Commercial Rates 1764 per year</ul>"
